{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-30","kind":"proposition","title":"平行关系的传递性","englishTitle":"Straight lines parallel to the same straight line are also parallel to one another.","book":1,"number":30,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.30","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.30/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":30,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","contentId":"euclid-1-30","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f3a2c831b8f39535556fef390f290ba61051cba2f7e62f6fa1b885e291a35aa","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-30.statement","euclid-1-30.construction.1","euclid-1-30.construction.2","euclid-1-30.proof.1","euclid-1-30.proof.2","euclid-1-30.proof.3","euclid-1-30.proof.4","euclid-1-30.conclusion","euclid-1-30.historical.1","euclid-1-30.historical.2","euclid-1-30.historical.3","euclid-1-30.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-30.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65b11b5f167c63c5b6e9108244d706c894be29277e536b137a5fbcaa6dc24f46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Straight lines parallel to the same straight line are also parallel to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与同一直线平行的直线也彼此平行。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线与他直线平行则元两线亦平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条线平行于其他线，则元的两条线也平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1a78bd877ff3d7058406c43ef75c6b3a554e3f1e205da34443022e7c1b0da15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let each of the straight lines AB, CD be parallel to EF; I say that AB is also parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,CD直线的每条线都与EF平行;我说,AB直线也与CD平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9a4306cc72ebe348aeb4fe9deec2c97ad6f60632bf1cbde0402f04d1d72afe3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line GK fall upon them;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线GK横线相交;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2833bee60ae5196d6f2a08475f144d32b0ed56d94687388421990a45eff619d8","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line GK has fallen on the parallel straight lines AB, EF, the angle AGK is equal to the angle GHF. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GK直线已经落到AB直线上 EF直线 AGK角等于GHF角 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b611a167d4b59c83f8dc920d172479b5c73827b80af1f27b6fb2ebf111ba1d90","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the straight line GK has fallen on the parallel straight lines EF, CD, the angle GHF is equal to the angle GKD. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于GK线线已倒在平行的EF线,CD线上,角度GHF等于角度GKD。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ef7c610c0c6cc99c262d2d247e38d346027e73c67d8bf2af39b57309cadb62b","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle AGK was also proved equal to the angle GHF; therefore the angle AGK is also equal to the angle GKD; [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] and they are alternate."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AGK角度也证明等于GHF角度;因此,AGK角度也等于GKD角度;它们是不同的。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69a59ee4deee86274ca47af665999303b94db45504916b2168d80088446d3eae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB is parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB项与CD项平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93924644e4fecee6dcec7375d51854fd637c45a4717711bae019e5885190b681","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线与他直线平行则元两线亦平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条线平行于其他线，则元的两条线也平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9bc4c021735e2e63731df56488f38f706a3f6b4b099652f2e0f4fd119627d5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：此题所指线在同面者不同面线后别有论如甲乙丙丁两直线各与他线戊巳平行题言甲乙与丙丁亦平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：本题中提到的线在同一平面上，但在不同的线之后，有不同的理论，例如 甲乙丙丁，两条直线平行于其他线 戊巳。命题解释：甲乙 和 丙丁 也平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d78a1ee9d8e06481403b450a631d5aee2a9836699e9b09a7cfaf820215e17baa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作庚辛直线交加于三直线甲乙于壬戊巳于子丙丁于癸其甲乙与戊巳既平行即甲壬子与相对之己子壬两内角等〈本篇廿九〉丙丁与戊巳既平行即丁癸子内角与己子壬外角亦等〈本篇廿九〉丁癸子与甲壬子亦为相对之内角亦等〈公论一〉而甲乙丙丁为平行线〈本篇廿七〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：一条线 庚辛 与三条线相交，甲乙 在 壬戊巳，子丙丁 在 癸，甲乙 和 戊巳 平行，即 甲壬子 和 己子壬 内角相等 〈本篇廿九〉丙丁 平行于 戊巳，丁癸子 和 己子壬 外角相等 〈本篇廿九〉丁癸子 和 甲壬子 也相对；内角也相等。〈公论一〉 和 甲乙丙丁 是平行线，〈本篇廿七〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-30.source","contentId":"euclid-1-30","revisionId":"euclid-1-30@raw-4f3a2c831b8f3953","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cef77718783ea3908e1a5d08be57873fbd07e80a639a435de1884cc4304292b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.30/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.30\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-30:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-30.proof.1","euclid-1-30.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.30","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.30/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-30:euclid-1-cn-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-30.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"eucli